From 6401a2ff8cefe7622f7949a23f830aaac40df66b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 10:05:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Default loaded notification f to legacy as
 containment

Default loaded_notification_f and its missing-key fallback to false. Explicit
true retains shared scheduling; false or unset uses legacy notification delivery
for newly initialized sessions. Existing in-memory lanes are not migrated.

Containment only: repeated shared JSON decoding and private-reader contention
require separate correction and measured acceptance before default activation.
Tests exercise missing display/key defaults, explicit OFF and explicit ON.
No live deployment or performance acceptance is claimed.

---
