 .../tui_gateway/test_loaded_notification_f.py | 24 +++++++++++++++++--
 tui_gateway/notification_loaded_f.py          |  2 +-
 tui_gateway/session_notifications.py          |  2 +-
 website/docs/user-guide/configuration.md      |  5 ++--
 5 files changed, 28 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

